## (A) Lumenora-authored custom shell scripts — MIT License

This section applies only to the following original Lumenora-authored shell scripts. It does not license recipes, configuration, themes, workflows, images, ISOs, or any other repository material.

Subject to the statement above, this section applies only to:

* `files/scripts/dedup-home-subvol.sh`
* `files/scripts/fish-default.sh`
* `files/scripts/lumen-theme.sh`
* `files/scripts/rebrand.sh`
* `files/scripts/swap-ogc-kernel.sh`
* `files/scripts/update-os.sh`
* `files/usr/bin/lumenora-gpu-detect.sh`
* `scripts/validate.sh`

If any listed script contains third-party content, that third-party content is excluded from this MIT grant and remains under its own license.

